  "We bridge human cognition and embodied AI to understand how social intelligence takes shape through interaction.": "我们联结人类认知与具身人工智能，探究社会智能如何在交互中成形。",
  "We bring together curious minds who are passionate about scientific discovery and interdisciplinary research at the intersection of cognitive science, artificial intelligence, and engineering.": "我们汇聚充满好奇心、热爱科学探索的人才，致力于认知科学、人工智能与工程交叉领域的跨学科研究。",
  "We investigate how humans perceive and integrate multimodal social cues to understand the cognitive mechanisms underlying social interaction. Inspired by these mechanisms, we develop computational models and embodied robotic systems to advance artificial social intelligence. Through human-robot interaction studies, we explore how people interact with intelligent agents, establishing a bidirectional link between human social cognition and embodied artificial intelligence.": "我们研究人类如何感知与整合多模态社会线索，以理解社会交互背后的认知机制。受这些机制启发，我们构建计算模型与具身机器人系统，推动人工社会智能的发展。通过人机交互研究，我们探索人们如何与智能体交互，在人类社会认知与具身人工智能之间建立双向联系。",
  "We welcome researchers and students interested in social cognition, human-AI interaction and embodied AI. Contact us to discuss opportunities to work with SEIL Lab.": "欢迎关注社会认知、人机交互与具身智能的研究人员和学生联系我们，探讨加入 SEIL 实验室或开展合作的机会。",
